%
( 5 EKSEN - STILIZE OZGURLUK HEYKELI / STATUE OF LIBERTY )
( Makine: 5-axis trunnion, RTCP/TCPM YOK )
( Kutuk: 100 x 100 x 60 mm blok, X/Y sifiri ortada, Z0 ust yuzey )
( A ekseni pivot noktasi: ust yuzeyin 20mm altinda [Z-20] )
( Sag el kurali: +A donusunde Y- tarafi yukselir )
( Takim: T1 [10mm parmak freze]. Makine takimsiz [T0] acilir; T1 M6 ile takilir, )
( panelde CONFIRM TC ile onaylanir )

G21 G17 G90 G54

T1 M6
S3000 M3
G0 Z130.0
G0 A0.0 C0.0

( ========================================================== )
( 1. ASAMA: KAIDE BASAMAGI - ALT CEVREYI 15MM ASAGI INDIR [A0] )
( Dis sinir 100x100 kalir, orta blok 68x68mm kaideye donusur )
( ========================================================== )
#1 = -5.0
o101 while [#1 GE -15.0]
  G0 X-44.0 Y-44.0
  G0 Z2.0
  G1 Z#1 F200
  G1 X44.0 F500
  G1 Y44.0 F500
  G1 X-44.0 F500
  G1 Y-44.0 F500
  #1 = [#1 - 5.0]
o101 endwhile
G0 Z130.0

( ========================================================== )
( 2. ASAMA: CUBBE / GOVDE KONIGI - 4 YANDA 25 DERECE EGIM [A25] )
( Orta kismi daraltarak uzun heykel govdesi + mesale kolu cikintisi birakir )
( ========================================================== )
#2 = 0.0
o102 while [#2 LT 359.0]
  G0 A25.0 C#2
  G0 Z130.0

  ( Y- tarafindaki yukselen govde kenarini tirasla )
  G0 X-32.0 Y-12.0
  G0 Z35.0
  G1 Z24.0 F200
  G1 X32.0 F450
  G1 Y-22.0 F450
  G1 X-32.0 F450

  ( Derin paso - ince siluet olusur )
  G0 Z35.0
  G0 X-28.0 Y-10.0
  G1 Z19.0 F180
  G1 X28.0 F400
  G1 Y-20.0 F400
  G1 X-28.0 F400

  G0 Z130.0
  #2 = [#2 + 90.0]
o102 endwhile

( ========================================================== )
( 3. ASAMA: CUBBE KIYRIMLARI / DIKEY PILILER [A90] )
( Govdenin 4 yan yuzeyine dikey cizgiler isler )
( ========================================================== )
#3 = 0.0
o103 while [#3 LT 359.0]
  G0 A90.0 C#3
  G0 Z130.0

  ( Sol pili )
  G0 X-10.0 Y-18.0
  G0 Z35.0
  G1 Z26.0 F150
  G1 X-12.0 Y-32.0 F300
  G0 Z35.0

  ( Orta pili )
  G0 X0.0 Y-18.0
  G1 Z26.0 F150
  G1 X0.0 Y-32.0 F300
  G0 Z35.0

  ( Sag pili )
  G0 X10.0 Y-18.0
  G1 Z26.0 F150
  G1 X12.0 Y-32.0 F300
  G0 Z130.0

  #3 = [#3 + 90.0]
o103 endwhile

( ========================================================== )
( 4. ASAMA: HAVAYA KALKAN MESALE KOLU VE MESALE BASI [A0] )
( Sag on kosede [X+18, Y-18] yuksek bir kule/mesale birakir, )
( bas bolgesinin etrafini oyarak taci ortaya cikarir )
( ========================================================== )
G0 A0.0 C0.0
G0 Z130.0

( Bas ve tac cevresini Z-8.0 derinlige oy - X+18 Y-18 mesalesine dokunma )
G0 X-22.0 Y22.0
G0 Z2.0
G1 Z-4.0 F180
G1 X-22.0 Y-22.0 F400
G1 X5.0 Y-22.0 F400       ( mesale kulesinin onunden dur )
G1 X5.0 Y-5.0 F400
G1 X22.0 Y-5.0 F400       ( mesale kulesinin arkasindan dolan )
G1 X22.0 Y22.0 F400
G1 X-22.0 Y22.0 F400

( Ikinci derinlik Z-8.0: tac ve mesale birbirinden tamamen ayrilir )
G1 Z-8.0 F180
G1 X-22.0 Y-22.0 F400
G1 X5.0 Y-22.0 F400
G1 X5.0 Y-5.0 F400
G1 X22.0 Y-5.0 F400
G1 X22.0 Y22.0 F400
G1 X-22.0 Y22.0 F400
G0 Z5.0

( Mesale alevi ucuna konik form ver [X+16, Y-16] )
G0 X16.0 Y-16.0
G1 Z-2.0 F120
G0 Z15.0

( ========================================================== )
( 5. ASAMA: 7 ISINLI TAC [CROWN SPIKES] - 35 DERECE EGIMLI [A35] )
( C eksenini 30 derece adimlarla dondurerek yarim dairede 7 isin acar )
( ========================================================== )
#4 = -90.0
o104 while [#4 LE 90.0]
  G0 A35.0 C#4
  G0 Z130.0

  ( Tac isini kanali - merkezdeki bas kulesinden disari dogru )
  G0 X0.0 Y-8.0
  G0 Z30.0
  G1 Z17.0 F150
  G1 X0.0 Y-22.0 F250
  G0 Z130.0

  #4 = [#4 + 30.0]
o104 endwhile

( ========================================================== )
( 6. ASAMA: SOL ELDEKI TABLET [BAGIMSIZLIK BILDIRGESI] [A45 C135] )
( Sol yan kosede egik bir kitap/tablet yuzeyi acar )
( ========================================================== )
G0 A45.0 C135.0
G0 Z130.0
G0 X-12.0 Y-22.0
G0 Z45.0
G1 Z34.0 F150
G1 X12.0 F300
G1 Y-28.0 F300
G1 X-12.0 F300
G0 Z130.0

M5
G0 A0.0 C0.0
G0 X0.0 Y0.0
M2
%